  "details": "The last update (VRChat 2020.3.2p3, build 976) partly fixed the vive analog input, but not entirely. So far analog works fine when pressing in the trigger, but when releasing the trigger the analog value goes straight back to zero no matter how far the trigger is still pressed. \nThis means you can press the trigger in halfway, and the fist animation is closed halfway, but if you release the trigger by a small amount, the hand opens completely instead of following the trigger.\nThe debug menu reveals that this happens when the analog value is decreased by more than 0.1",
